{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>Do not be hasty.</b> The meaning of תבהל is like \"do not hasten,\" and similarly ויבהילו להבית את המן (they hastened to bring Haman). I have already explained this verse under the verse \"good is anger.\""], :book :ecclesiastes, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 7, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Wikisource" "https://he.wikisource.org/wiki/%D7%90%D7%91%D7%9F_%D7%A2%D7%96%D7%A8%D7%90_%D7%A2%D7%9C_%D7%A7%D7%94%D7%9C%D7%AA"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:28:02.452587306Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}